  - planned hires and their monthly cost
  - planned one-time spends (large contracts, capex)
  - AR aging / DSO
- I can also draft a one-slide summary + two backup slides (12-month cash model and sensitivity table) ready for your internal review.

If you want, tell me:
- Which definition of burn you use (net cash burn vs opex)
- Whether the $4.0M was cash collected last quarter or recognized revenue (and any AR balance)
- Any planned hires, product or marketing spend in the next 12 months

I’ll then produce a clean paragraph narrative and a 12-month cash runway table/scenario model you can paste into your materials.

