- Upside: potential to reduce burn through efficiency, convert revenue into cash faster, or deploy incremental cash into high-ROI growth.

Sensitivity and quick math to include (useful slide or appendix)
- Base (stated): $1.2M / $45K = 26.7 months (~27 months)
