- Burn +20%: $54K → 1.2M / 54K = 22.2 months
- Burn −20%: $36K → 1.2M / 36K = 33.3 months
- One-time cash need example: a $500K one-time outlay reduces cash to $700K → runway = 700K / 45K = 15.6 months
- To extend runway to 36 months at current burn ($45K): needed cash = 45K * 36 = 1.62M → incremental required ≈ $420K

