- Base (current): burn = $45K → runway ≈ 26.7 months
- Tighter (burn increases to $75K/month): runway = 1,200,000 / 75,000 = 16 months
- Growth-investment (burn increases to $150K/month during scale-up): runway = 8 months
- Cost-reduction (burn falls to $30K/month): runway = 40 months
