- Chart 3: Burn drivers waterfall for the last quarter (payroll, R&D, marketing, other).
- One-liner for CFO slide: “Stable liquidity with $1.2M cash and ~27 months of runway at current net burn ($45K/month). Revenue last quarter of $4.0M keeps net cash burn low relative to revenue (≈3.4%), enabling optionality for targeted investments with limited near-term liquidity risk.”

