- Track DSO and collections weekly for the next quarter; if DSO exceeds target, implement collection-focused incentives.
- Identify short-term expense levers (freeze discretionary hiring, S&M pacing, vendor term negotiation) that buy runway if needed.
- Prepare contingency financing options (credit line, bridge investor commitments) if runway under downside scenarios falls below internal thresholds.

