- Current cash: $1.2M. Reported net cash burn: $45K/month (assumption A) — this implies ~26.7 months of runway (1.2M / 45K). If instead the 30-month runway figure incorporates anticipated near-term inflows or one-time items, the implied net burn is closer to $40K/month.
