- Net burn reflects operating cash outflows beyond collections. High revenue with positive gross margin can still produce net cash burn if cash collections are delayed or investment spending is elevated.

Implications and focus areas
- With ~27 months of runway we are well-positioned to execute growth initiatives but should monitor cash conversion and margin trends.
- Key priorities: optimize receivables collection, tighten working capital, validate revenue collection timing, and track one-time vs recurring expenses.

