  - After 24 months: cash ≈ $240K
  - Runway = 30 months

3 scenario examples to include in materials
- Base case: current burn sustained → runway = 26.7 months (or 30 months if assumptions hold). Highlight key assumptions (AR collection %, gross margin, hiring).
- Downside: 10% revenue collections slowdown + 10% higher opex → runway falls by ~10–15% (show $ and months).
- Upside: improved collections and 15–25% reduction in noncritical spend → runway extends to 32–36 months.

Recommended “ask” and action items for leadership
1. Reconcile and document runway assumptions now (collections schedule, one-offs, capex, and deferred revenue).
