- Sensitivity (runway in months)
  - Base (45K/mo): 26.7 months
  - +25% burn (56.25K/mo): 21.3 months
  - -50% burn (22.5K/mo): 53.3 months

- Cash balance projection (base burn = $45K/mo)
  - Month 0: $1,200,000
  - Month 1: $1,155,000
  - Month 3: $1,065,000
  - Month 6: $930,000
  - Month 12: $660,000
  - Month 24: $120,000
  - Month ~26.7: $0

