- One-line summary slide with the executive summary and the reconciliation note.
- 24-month cash forecast chart (monthly) with shaded bands for base / conservative / growth scenarios.
- Table: key assumptions (definition of burn, cash components, revenue recognition / collections timing).
- Waterfall of material cash changes planned this year (hiring, product spend, marketing).
- Sensitivity table showing runway under burn changes and revenue +/- 20%.

Risks to call out explicitly
