- “Burn” is being reported differently: e.g., the $45K is gross burn (operating cash outflows) while runway is computed using net burn (operating outflows minus recurring cash inflows like collections), or runway assumes some revenue or cost reductions going forward.
- Runway includes expected near-term financing, one-time items, or anticipated changes in costs/revenue.
