“As of today, Summit holds $1.2M in cash. Using our current operating burn of $45K per month, that cash supports approximately 26.7 months of runway. Revenue last quarter was $4.0M (≈$1.33M/month), meaning our operating spend is a small fraction of revenue (~3.4%). The stated 30‑month runway implies a slightly lower assumed net burn (~$40K/month) or planned near-term inflows/cost reductions — we should confirm which assumption is being used in the board materials.”

