- Revenue context: Last quarter revenue of $4.0M annualizes to ~$16M. Given that monthly revenue (~$1.33M) is far greater than our operating burn, the business is revenue-covering; the cash draw appears limited and may be driven by non-recurring cash uses (capex, one-time payments, acquisitions, dividends/recapitalization, or timing of collections/payments).
